title: A Comrade in Prison
subtitle: One of the party's leaders is behind bars.
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and sys_prisoners_timer <= 0 and comrades_in_prison >= 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.sys_prisoners_timer = 3;
Q.month_actions += 1;
var pr = Q.comrades.filter(function (c) { return c.status == 'prison'; });
var c = pr[Math.floor(Math.random() * pr.length)];
Q.sys_prisoner = c.id;
Q.sys_prisoner_name = c.name;
Q.sys_prisoner_role = c.role;
Q.sys_prisoner_guards = Q.red_guards_strength >= 1 ? 1 : 0;
Q.sys_outcome = 0;
!}
frequency: 150
is-card: true
tags: movement

= A Comrade in Prison

**[+ sys_prisoner_name +]** ([+ sys_prisoner_role +]) is in prison. The letters that get out are cheerful and heavily censored.

- @campaign: Campaign for the release.
- @escape: Get [+ sys_prisoner_name +] out.
- @hunger: Let [+ sys_prisoner_name +] refuse food.
- @exchange: Ask Moscow to arrange an exchange.
- @easy_discard

@campaign
subtitle: Meetings, petitions, questions in parliament. The more workers are with us, the likelier it works.
on-arrival: {!
Q.worker_support += 2;
if (Math.random() < 0.3 + Q.worker_support / 200) {
    Q.sys_outcome = 1;
    RG.free(Q.sys_prisoner);
} else {
    Q.sys_outcome = 2;
}
!}

[? if sys_outcome = 1 : The court finds a reason to release [+ sys_prisoner_name +] early. ?][? if sys_outcome = 2 : The prison stays shut, but the whole country knows the name. ?]

@escape
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. The red guard's man inside thinks it will work, more likely than not. If it fails, the sentence grows.
choose-if: resources >= 1 and sys_prisoner_guards = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if sys_prisoner_guards = 0 : We have nobody who could do it. ?][? if sys_prisoner_guards = 1 : We have no funds. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
if (Math.random() < 0.6) {
    Q.sys_outcome = 1;
    RG.free(Q.sys_prisoner, {news: Q.sys_prisoner_name + ' escapes from prison', priority: 2});
    Q.repression += 4;
} else {
    Q.sys_outcome = 2;
    Q.repression += 4;
    var c = RG.comrade(Q.sys_prisoner);
    if (c && c.until > 0) { c.until += 4; }
}
!}

[? if sys_outcome = 1 : A warder with debts, a forged transfer order and a car at the corner: [+ sys_prisoner_name +] is out, and underground. ?][? if sys_outcome = 2 : The warder talks. The car is stopped two streets away, and the sentence is longer for it. ?]

@hunger
subtitle: A hunger strike may shame the prison into a release. It is hard on the body.
on-arrival: {!
var r = Math.random();
if (r < 0.4) {
    Q.sys_outcome = 1;
    RG.free(Q.sys_prisoner, {news: Q.sys_prisoner_name + ' released after hunger strike', priority: 2});
} else {
    Q.sys_outcome = 2;
    Q.militancy += 3;
}
Q.worker_support += 2;
!}

[+ sys_prisoner_name +] refuses food for nineteen days. [? if sys_outcome = 1 : The prison doctor certifies that the prisoner is unfit to be held, and the ministry gives way. ?][? if sys_outcome = 2 : The prison feeds the prisoner by force. The works hear about it. ?]

@exchange
subtitle: The comrade goes free into exile in Russia, and we owe Moscow for it.
view-if: comintern_member = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.independence -= 5;
if (Math.random() < 0.7) {
    Q.sys_outcome = 1;
    RG.exile(Q.sys_prisoner, {news: Q.sys_prisoner_name + ' exchanged and sent to Moscow'});
} else {
    Q.sys_outcome = 2;
}
!}

[? if sys_outcome = 1 : Soviet diplomats trade [+ sys_prisoner_name +] for two German officers held in Russia. ?][? if sys_outcome = 2 : Berlin refuses the exchange. ?]
